      "sourceHash": "fdafbdcf97f6c253ab7cc718a6763a1186126373ddeb056a8cf746b3eb900e8c",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.15,
          "end": 4.86,
          "en": "In this project, which we have here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.86,
          "end": 8.99,
          "en": "we currently only have one page, the index.js page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.99,
          "end": 12.13,
          "en": "Now there we're rendering some dummy product data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.13,
          "end": 16.23,
          "en": "and it's very simple dummy product data, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 16.23,
          "end": 19.96,
          "en": "Now what if our data there was a bit more complex?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 19.96,
          "end": 23.95,
          "en": "So every product also had a description, let's say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 23.95,
          "end": 25.64,
          "en": "And I'll keep this very simple here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.64,
          "end": 28.61,
          "en": "since I want to focus on the Next.js features,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.61,
          "end": 30.773,
          "en": "not on this concrete example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.65,
          "end": 35.55,
          "en": "So here, the description is this is product one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 35.55,
          "end": 38.51,
          "en": "It's one extra JSON key added here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 38.51,
          "end": 42.42,
          "en": "And on the second product, it's this is product two.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 42.42,
          "end": 44.1,
          "en": "And you might be able to imagine",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 44.1,
          "end": 46.46,
          "en": "what it will be on the third product.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.46,
          "end": 48.403,
          "en": "Yes, this is product three.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.29,
          "end": 53.84,
          "en": "Now the idea could be that on the index.js file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 53.84,
          "end": 55.77,
          "en": "we render a list of products,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.77,
          "end": 58.18,
          "en": "and every product is a clickable link,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 58.18,
          "end": 60.91,
          "en": "which takes us to a detail page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 60.91,
          "end": 64.07,
          "en": "where we then also see the description of the product.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 64.07,
          "end": 66.38,
          "en": "So similar to what we built before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 66.38,
          "end": 68.87,
          "en": "in our project with the events,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.87,
          "end": 71.82300000000001,
          "en": "we have a detail page for the products.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 72.74,
          "end": 75.09,
          "en": "And for this, we can of course, add a new page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 75.09,
          "end": 78.22,
          "en": "with a dynamic segment between square brackets.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 78.22,
          "end": 81.87,
          "en": "And here we could name this PID, for product ID,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 81.87,
          "end": 85.76,
          "en": "but that identifier is up to you, dot js.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 85.76,
          "end": 88.45,
          "en": "So that's now a dynamic page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 88.45,
          "end": 92.35,
          "en": "Alternatively, we create a folder named PID like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 92.35,
          "end": 95.34,
          "en": "and in there we then have an index.js file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 95.34,
          "end": 97.72,
          "en": "but I'll stick to this setup.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 97.72,
          "end": 100.8,
          "en": "And here we could now add a component function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 100.8,
          "end": 104.68299999999999,
          "en": "which is the product detail page, let's say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 105.56,
          "end": 110.03,
          "en": "And the idea is, that in this component on this page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 110.03,
          "end": 112.56,
          "en": "we show the product details.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 112.56,
          "end": 116.34,
          "en": "So to keep this simple, I just want to return,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 116.34,
          "end": 120.6,
          "en": "let's say a fragment here, imported from React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 120.6,
          "end": 122.94,
          "en": "And there I then have an H1 tag",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 122.94,
          "end": 125.21,
          "en": "with the title of the product,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 125.21,
          "end": 128.92,
          "en": "and below that, a paragraph with the description.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 128.92,
          "end": 131.87,
          "en": "But that data should now be fetched",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 131.87,
          "end": 135.38,
          "en": "from the dummy backend JSON file as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 135.38,
          "end": 137.34,
          "en": "Now again, of course, we could write",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 137.34,
          "end": 140.11,
          "en": "standard React code here, so to say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 140.11,
          "end": 143.515,
          "en": "and use useEffect imported from React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 143.515,
          "end": 147.26,
          "en": "to send a HTTP request to some server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 147.26,
          "end": 150.46,
          "en": "which might provide this product data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 150.46,
          "end": 152.68,
          "en": "But then we're back in the world where",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 152.68,
          "end": 157.68,
          "en": "that data is not there when this page is initially rendered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 157.9,
          "end": 160.8,
          "en": "So search engines still wouldn't see it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 160.8,
          "end": 162.993,
          "en": "so that's not what we'll do here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 164.05,
          "end": 165.77,
          "en": "Instead, what we will do here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 165.77,
          "end": 168.76,
          "en": "is we will again use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 168.76,
          "end": 171.25,
          "en": "this async prop function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 171.25,
          "end": 174.893,
          "en": "So we'll export this async function getStaticProps.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 176.2,
          "end": 179.17000000000002,
          "en": "This function is again a function we can use here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 179.17000000000002,
          "end": 180.64,
          "en": "and here we then, again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 180.64,
          "end": 183.51,
          "en": "want to reach out to the backend JSON file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 183.51,
          "end": 186.67,
          "en": "but now instead of reading",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 186.67,
          "end": 189.93,
          "en": "the entire file and returning all products,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 189.93,
          "end": 192.51,
          "en": "I want to read the file and only return",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 192.51,
          "end": 194.64,
          "en": "one product from that file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 194.64,
          "end": 197.05,
          "en": "That will be the difference.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 197.05,
          "end": 199.26,
          "en": "And therefore of course we need to know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 199.26,
          "end": 202.21,
          "en": "which product should be returned here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 202.21,
          "end": 204.37,
          "en": "And of course, that's something we can determine",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 204.37,
          "end": 207.333,
          "en": "by looking at the concrete value, which is in the URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 208.22,
          "end": 212.32,
          "en": "So to concrete value for this PID key here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 212.32,
          "end": 214.76,
          "en": "That's where does context parameter again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 214.76,
          "end": 218.46,
          "en": "becomes important because I did briefly mention before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 218.46,
          "end": 221.18,
          "en": "that we can use this context parameter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 221.18,
          "end": 224.44,
          "en": "which is exposed to us buying Next.js,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 224.44,
          "end": 228,
          "en": "to get hold of the concrete param values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 228,
          "end": 231.91,
          "en": "So the concrete values for these dynamic segments",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 231.91,
          "end": 233.063,
          "en": "in our paths.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 234.29,
          "end": 237.03,
          "en": "We do get access to that by having a look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 237.03,
          "end": 240.75,
          "en": "at the params key in context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 240.75,
          "end": 243.15,
          "en": "Now that's not a name I came up with,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 243.15,
          "end": 245.43,
          "en": "instead, that is one of the properties",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 245.43,
          "end": 247.72,
          "en": "exposed by this context object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 247.72,
          "end": 250.72,
          "en": "which is given to you by Next.js.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 250.72,
          "end": 255.41,
          "en": "And params is an object full of key value pairs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 255.41,
          "end": 258.37,
          "en": "where the keys are the identifiers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 258.37,
          "end": 261.03,
          "en": "for the dynamic path segments.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 261.03,
          "end": 263.12,
          "en": "So in this case, PID,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 263.12,
          "end": 266.9,
          "en": "which is the only dynamic parameter of this page here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 266.9,
          "end": 269.67,
          "en": "and the values are the concrete values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 269.67,
          "end": 271.12,
          "en": "that were entered in the URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 272.65999999999997,
          "end": 275.45,
          "en": "So here I then get my product ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 275.45,
          "end": 277.69,
          "en": "by accessing params.pid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 277.69,
          "end": 280.743,
          "en": "PID because that's what I picked here on the file name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 281.88,
          "end": 284.96,
          "en": "Now, one quick note about extracting the params here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 284.96,
          "end": 286.82,
          "en": "to avoid confusion.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 286.82,
          "end": 290.163,
          "en": "Of course, you can also extract params",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 290.163,
          "end": 291.83,
          "en": "through the use router hook",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 291.83,
          "end": 293.85,
          "en": "inside of the component function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 293.85,
          "end": 296.85,
          "en": "That's what we did before in this course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 296.85,
          "end": 299.27,
          "en": "We got access to that router object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 299.27,
          "end": 300.72,
          "en": "with the useRouter hook,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 300.72,
          "end": 304.91,
          "en": "and we extracted params with router.query.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 304.91,
          "end": 308.38,
          "en": "Now there is a difference between extracting params",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 308.38,
          "end": 312.33,
          "en": "in the component function and the getStaticProps.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 312.33,
          "end": 316.8,
          "en": "When we extract these params in the component function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 316.8,
          "end": 319.05,
          "en": "we can use them inside of the component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 319.05,
          "end": 322.54,
          "en": "for example to use that extracted ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 322.54,
          "end": 325.03,
          "en": "to send a request to some backend server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 325.03,
          "end": 326.7,
          "en": "to fetch data from there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 326.7,
          "end": 331.37,
          "en": "but that would then only happen in the browser.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 331.37,
          "end": 333.93,
          "en": "If you want to pre-render a page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 333.93,
          "end": 336.09000000000003,
          "en": "with help of getStaticProps,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 336.09000000000003,
          "end": 338.23,
          "en": "which we use to prepare the data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 338.23,
          "end": 340.1,
          "en": "for pre-rendering the page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 340.1,
          "end": 342.32,
          "en": "then this happens on the server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 342.32,
          "end": 345.067,
          "en": "And as I explained, getStaticProps runs before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 345.067,
          "end": 346.95,
          "en": "the component function runs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 346.95,
          "end": 348.73,
          "en": "It needs to run before that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 348.73,
          "end": 350.29,
          "en": "because the component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 350.29,
          "end": 353.33299999999997,
          "en": "is then executed to pre-render the page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 354.19,
          "end": 357.88,
          "en": "So if you plan on preparing a page on the server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 357.88,
          "end": 361.34,
          "en": "or during the build process with getStaticProps,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 361.34,
          "end": 364.3,
          "en": "then you need to get access to the params,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 364.3,
          "end": 367.4,
          "en": "so to that dynamic path segment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 367.4,
          "end": 369.67,
          "en": "inside of getStaticProps",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 369.67,
          "end": 372.1,
          "en": "so that you can use the param data here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 372.1,
          "end": 375.47,
          "en": "to prepare the data for the component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 375.47,
          "end": 379,
          "en": "Then we don't need to extract that dynamic segment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 379,
          "end": 380.62,
          "en": "in the component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 380.62,
          "end": 383.49,
          "en": "unless we also need it there for some reason.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 383.49,
          "end": 385.14,
          "en": "But for preparing the data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 385.14,
          "end": 387.243,
          "en": "we then want to do that in getStaticProps.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 388.53,
          "end": 390.89,
          "en": "And now with that, we could reach out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 390.89,
          "end": 394.54,
          "en": "to our file, to the dummy backend JSON file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 394.54,
          "end": 398.093,
          "en": "and try to read that product with that ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 399.06,
          "end": 403.3,
          "en": "So for this I'll briefly copy that code from index.js,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
